  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "description": "Explains what this dashboard or section shows.",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Answers:** which memory operations ran, which failed or were denied, how many records and bytes they moved, and how models used the memory tools.\n\n**Data comes from:** every LLM step of a workflow run with memory configured (retrieval, ranking, packet assembly, injection, capture, denial), the Anthropic native memory tool (the only source of byte counts), and the standard memory tools (`memory.tool_call` spans, written when a model calls a memory tool).\n\nA failure class does not always mean an error: `retrieval_empty_result` and `policy_denial` appear on operations that completed normally.\n\nThe stack keeps traces for 24 hours, so no panel can look further back than that."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Memory operations",
      "description": "How many memory operations ran?",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.namespace =~ \"$namespace\" && name = \"memory.operation\" } | count_over_time()",
          "filters": [],
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces",
          "metricsQueryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
